onds, 16:9 widescreen. Clean refined line art, cel shading, translucent hair highlights, dominated by purple and black, accented with magenta neon glow and cool cyan rim light. Background is dim Livehouse bar stage, floating Tyndall light dust, blurred band silhouettes, flowing purple haze, strobing beams and bokeh highlights. Keep the same anime girl character throughout: short wavy silvery-white bob hair, pale cool grey eyes, delicate soft facial features, black off-shoulder short-sleeve top, purple-black color-block pleated mini skirt, black over-the-knee stockings, black loafers, tiny stud earrings.\nOpening frontal close-up of face. She holds a microphone, lips parted singing softly, hair swaying gently with her breath, eyes calm and expressive. Camera moves forward slightly and quickly, hair tips drift in stage wind.\n[Shot 2] At 00:01.800, hard cut to extreme close-up of eyes. Clear layered pale grey iris, purple stage highlight slides across iris, tiny magenta and cyan light fragments drift past frame edges.\n[Shot 3] At 00:03.000, purple haze graphic bursts outward, revealing tilted bust close-up. She turns her head quickly, then looks back toward camera, short hair swings with inertia. Camera pulls back fast, background band silhouettes and light beams slide in separate layers.\n[Shot 4] At 00:05.000, hard cut to wide-angle medium shot. She lifts her microphone hand forward gently, arm occupies part of foreground, face stays clear behind. Camera pulls back slightly, arm holds pose, skirt and hair keep swaying. Short purple-black stripes streak across frame, creating glitch transition.\n[Shot 5] At 00:07.000, cut to facial close-up. She tilts head slightly while singing, relaxed neck and shoulder line, confident cool gaze. Camera slowly pushes in, tiny purple light sparkles flicker beside her face.\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.000, screen splits into three horizontal panels: top panel shows eyes and spotlight, middle panel shows flowing silver hair, bottom panel shows purple-black pleated skirt. Three panels slide in opposite directions for a short distance, then snap back into full character.\n[Shot 7] At 00:11.000, low-angle oblique close-up. She turns shoulders while singing, skirt sweeps across foreground, body grooves to drum beats. Purple spotlight sweeps along her motion, camera rolls slightly clockwise, hair and skirt follow movement naturally.\n[Shot 8] At 00:13.000, cut to full frontal shot. She stops grooving, raises the microphone hand to her chest, shoulders slightly pulled back, face tilts up a little, sharp cool striking freeze pose, eyes gazing straight at camera. Purple spotlight bursts and illuminates her whole body at the moment of freeze, rim light flares out, the frame holds static freeze from 14s to 15s, no color blocks sliding in to cover screen.\nCharacter facial features, hairstyle and outfit stay consistent in all shots, correct natural separated fingers. Glitch and light effects only apply on overlay layers. No subtitles, no titles, no logos, no watermarks.\noverall_soundscape:\nShort fabric rustle sound when skirt sweeps, subtle electronic glitch sound for panel cuts, soft splash sound when haze bursts; at 14s freeze moment, heavy impact beat sound plus crisp metal click locking sound, vocal performance fades out on freeze. Female singing vocal runs through before freeze.\nnon_diegetic_music:\n128 BPM rock live track, tight kick drum, crisp snare, electric guitar riffs, bassline, cuts synced perfectly with heavy beats. The freeze at 14s lands on the hardest drum hit, brief silence after the heavy beat as ending."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [630.290771484375, 462.6627502441406], "pos": [-2031.0970458984375, 6061.8876953125], "id": 217, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0"